    },
    "voice": "produce_events/201402003/2014020030020"
  },
  {
    "id": 2014020030030,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "お父さんとお母さんもかっこいいけど\r\nお仕事してるところは見たことないし",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile2",
    "charAnim3": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201402003/2014020030030"
  },
  {
    "id": 2014020030040,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "社長さんだと、あまり接してきてないから\r\nイメージしづらいかも、って",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201402003/2014020030040"
  },
  {
    "id": 2014020030050,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "だから、甘奈にとってのかっこいい大人像は\r\nプロデューサーさん！　です！",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201402003/2014020030050"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……そこまで言われると\r\n少し照れるな……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "けど、わかった……！\r\nそれなら、全力で答えよう",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002",
    "se": "0327"
  },
  {
    "id": 2014020030060,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "ありがと！",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
